{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Vappa","html":"<article id='thag1.61'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.61 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.61 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Sattamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Seven </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Vappattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Vappa </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Passati passo passantaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>One who sees </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>apassantañca passati; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>sees those who see and those who don’t. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Apassanto apassantaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>One who doesn’t see </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>passantañca na passatī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>sees neither. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Vappo thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
